# Home screen: boot, tap the counter button, turn pages with keys and swipes.
# Coordinates in dp / % so the same script runs on every panel.
@3s      snap  boot
+500ms   tap   116dp 92dp       # counter button (16..216 dp x 64..120 dp)
+1500ms  tap   116dp 92dp
+1500ms  key   next             # page turn (text refresh)
+1500ms  key   next
+1500ms  swipe 88% 55% 15% 55% 250ms
+1500ms  key   next
+1500ms  key   next
+1500ms  key   next
+1500ms  key   next
+2s      snap  end
+500ms   end
